                             purple→chartSeriesPower · blue→chartSeriesSpeed · orange→TSChartPalette.color(5) (Wong
                             orange; no semantic orange token; keeps the warm/cool temp split) · secondary→textSecondary
  fmtNumber/fmtInt/fmtWithUnit + toEfficiencyDisplay  → MoreDetailsFormat (halfUp grouping, safeNumber guard, ×1.609344)
  i18n  : all 13 source labels + chrome resolve through MoreDetailsStrings (NSLocalizedString table "MoreDetailsPanel",
          web English fallbacks); unit symbols (km/mi/°C/Wh per km…) render verbatim as in the web source — zero
          English literals in code.
  a11y  : each tile is one VoiceOver element ("{label}, {value} {unit}"; elevation reads Gain/Loss); icons decorative
          (.accessibilityHidden); header carries .isHeader; Dynamic Type via system fonts; reduce-motion honored by TSFadeIn.
  tele  : view.opened surface="MoreDetailsPanel" via MoreDetailsModel.start() (P1/S11), default OSLog sink.

